    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>CANCELED DUE TO INJURY</p> <p>The cast in the midst of the translation process for <em>Silly Billy</em>, in rehearsal this January. We would love to share this new work with you, as it’s developed to be unexpected and humorous for both children and adults. Here is how to see <em>Silly Billy</em> in action this month:</p> "
      }
