        "@value": "We are incredibly excited to return to Québec with Dancing The Seven Teachings in Sherbrooke! Our family-friendly show features two works by Malgorzata Nowacka-May (with additional choreography by Arik Pipestem): Bears Stars & Trees and Trickster’s Romeo & Juliet featuring our wonderful Chimera artists Emma Curtis, Arik Pipestem and Sebastian Hirtenstein. Tickets can be purchased here! Nous sommes vraiment […]"
      },
