      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>We are incredibly excited to return to Québec with <em>Dancing The Seven Teachings </em>in Sherbrooke! Our family-friendly show features two works by Malgorzata Nowacka-May (with additional choreography by Arik Pipestem): <em>Bears Stars &amp; Trees </em>and <em>Trickster&#8217;s Romeo &amp; Juliet </em>featuring our wonderful Chimera artists Emma Curtis, Arik Pipestem and Sebastian Hirtenstein.</p> <p><a href='https://reseau.ovation.ca/Reservation/Billets/ChoixBillets.asp?CodeRepresentation=1D05HM&amp;PER=37tOO30&amp;CodeSiteClient=00000O&amp;Lang=FR&amp;_gl=1*12n8ctp*_ga*NzEzOTE1NzYyLjE3NDM2MjA1MjM.*_ga_8QMLWEW3BC*MTc0NTUzOTk2OC44LjEuMTc0NTUzOTk4MS4wLjAuMA..'>Tickets can be purchased here!</a></p> <p class='' data-start='82' data-end='508'>Nous sommes vraiment enthousiastes de revenir au Québec avec <em data-start='151' data-end='180'>Dancing The Seven Teachings</em>, présenté à Sherbrooke!vNotre spectacle familial met en vedette deux œuvres chorégraphiées par Malgorzata Nowacka-May (avec la chorégraphie additionnelle d’Arik Pipestem) : <em>Ours</em><em data-start='358' data-end='379'> étoiles et arbres</em> et <em>Le</em><em data-start='383' data-end='411'> Romeo &amp; Juliet du Trickster</em>, avec nos magnifiques artistes de Chimera : Emma Curtis, Arik Pipestem et Sebastian Hirtenstein.</p> <p class='' data-start='510' data-end='544'><a href='https://reseau.ovation.ca/Reservation/Billets/ChoixBillets.asp?CodeRepresentation=1D05HM&amp;PER=37tOO30&amp;CodeSiteClient=00000O&amp;Lang=FR&amp;_gl=1*12n8ctp*_ga*NzEzOTE1NzYyLjE3NDM2MjA1MjM.*_ga_8QMLWEW3BC*MTc0NTUzOTk2OC44LjEuMTc0NTUzOTk4MS4wLjAuMA..'>Les billets sont en vente ici!</a></p> "
      }
    ],
