  {
    "@id": "http://www.chimeradt.com/events/silly-billy-prologue-performing-arts/event_11277_0",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Event"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://chimeradt.com/events/silly-billy-prologue-performing-arts/"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://chimeradt.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Silly-Billy-126-copy.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.chimeradt.com/events/silly-billy-prologue-performing-arts/%23respond"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Silly Billy | Prologue Performing Arts | Toronto"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Among our main projects for the summer is another round of school performances with Prologue Performing Arts! While we&#8217;re touring our children&#8217;s show <em>Silly Billy</em> all over the Greater Toronto Area (with Arik Pipestem as our courageous Great White Buffalo and Emma Curtis as our beautiful Unicorn) we will also be developing a version of <em>Silly Billy</em> for Francophone audiences.</p> <p>Parmi nos projets phares cet été, on reprend la route des écoles avec Prologue Performing Arts! Pendant qu’on fait tourner notre spectacle jeunesse <em data-start='283' data-end='296'>Silly Billy</em> à travers la région de Toronto (avec Arik Pipestem dans le rôle du courageux Grand Buffle Blanc et Emma Curtis dans celui de notre magnifique Licorne), on développera également une version de <em data-start='495' data-end='508'>Silly Billy</em> destinée au public francophone.</p> <p><a href='https://chimeradt.com/repertoire-silly-billy/'>More information on <em>Silly Billy!</em> / Plus d&#8217;info sur <em>Silly Billy !</em></a></p> <p>June 10: Princess Margaret Junior School, Etobicoke &amp; Runnymede Junior and Senior Public School, Toronto</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2025-6-10T10:00+0::00"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/endDate": [
